{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國西藏與尼泊爾接壤邊境於昨日（26日）爆發特大泥石流及山洪災害，引發嚴重人員傷亡與大量人員失聯。據內地媒體報道，截至目前，已救出2人，3人遇難、558人失聯，而根據尼泊爾國家減少災害風險管理局在27日發布的統計數據，尼泊爾北部26日爆發山洪後已找到165具遇難者遺體，另有826人失蹤，兩國至少168死近1400人失蹤。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h37m47s877.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026r86Gw6zNgU1787813495.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h37m47s877.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h38m15s826.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20269PzTylnDWb1787813524.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h38m15s826.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網路今日流傳一段第一身驚險影片，直擊山洪泥石流爆發時的生死一刻。片段顯示，事發時多名身穿橘色反光背心及頭盔的工程人員突接獲警報，紛紛沿山路向高處狂奔。未幾，後方山谷傳出巨響，滾滾塵暴與泥石巨浪排山倒海順流而下，瞬間吞噬河道及周邊設施。現場人員在厚重塵土掩蓋下，手腳並用攀爬路邊陡峭石堆避難，險象環生。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h42m34s391.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZHJ01Afb1Z1787813540.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-14h42m34s391.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T07:19:32.919116+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}